# CMS API base URL. Everything on the site — projects, skills, bio — is loaded
# from here, so the API must be running. Left unset it defaults to
# http://localhost:4000, which is what `npm run dev --prefix backend` serves.
# In production this is required, and it is compiled in at build time.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
